ion 2.0, part 3) added lanes 5bA to 5bF over the seams it cut: crates/derm-cli/src/hook/claude_format/ and native/, gate/serve/, enter/, run/boundary/windows_srt/, the derm-sysmon crate and the daemon's platform/windows/sysmon_feed/; crates/derm-cli/src/gate/ outside serve/ and hook/mod.rs are integration's. Each package lane keeps the synced src/core/ excepted, as wave 4 did. Lane names with digits are taken as written (`5bA`), and their markers are `# [lane-5bA]`.",
